Verse 74:31 gives five objectives for the number 19 :

(1) a punishment for the disbelievers;

(2) to convince the Jews and Christians that Quran is a divine scripture;

(3) to strengthen the faith of the believers;

(4) to remove all traces of doubt from the hearts of the Muslims, Christians, and Jews, regarding the authenticity and integrity of Quran; and

(5) to expose the hypocrites and disbelievers; they remain indifferent, despite overwhelming physical evidence.

[Arabic Quranic Verse 74:31]

The previous generations were given a temporary interpretation, through the general statement, "The guardians of hell are angels." Thus, the old interpretation has been, "The guards of hell are 19."
